[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676292183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2676292183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2676292183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhPpX","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T16:27:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T16:35:14Z","body":"This is changing code that hasn't changed in 3 years. And the error has been around since switch statements were added 6 years ago (in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/31596). Therefore, I don't think it is responsible for the change in behaviour between 4.3 and 4.4. I definitely wouldn't remove an error check that has been around for 3 years at this point in the 4.x dev cycle without a very compelling reason. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676292183/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676309591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2676309591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2676309591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhT5X","user":{"login":"Murrent","id":43298787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjk4Nzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43298787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent","html_url":"https://github.com/Murrent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T17:05:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T17:05:27Z","body":"> This is changing code that hasn't changed in 3 years. And the error has been around since switch statements were added 6 years ago (in #31596). Therefore, I don't think it is responsible for the change in behaviour between 4.3 and 4.4. I definitely wouldn't remove an error check that has been around for 3 years at this point in the 4.x dev cycle without a very compelling reason.\r\n\r\nThe code for the error has been there for a long time, but for some unknown reason the error didn't hit in previous versions. And default case is allowed at the top of switch scopes in GLSL. Right now it is a breaking change in behavior between 4.3 and 4.4 to the user, which I'm trying to fix. But yeah, I get your concern for potential side effects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676309591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676317443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2676317443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2676317443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhV0D","user":{"login":"Murrent","id":43298787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjk4Nzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43298787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent","html_url":"https://github.com/Murrent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T17:26:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T17:26:37Z","body":"Also, one good reason why this change is needed is that people who rely on large external GLSL libraries might have to make a lot of changes to the libraries since the compiler is not fully compatible with GLSL. This is the problem I have with my own project. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676317443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676522314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2676522314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2676522314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fiH1K","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-23T02:43:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-23T02:43:17Z","body":"> > This is changing code that hasn't changed in 3 years. And the error has been around since switch statements were added 6 years ago (in #31596). Therefore, I don't think it is responsible for the change in behaviour between 4.3 and 4.4. I definitely wouldn't remove an error check that has been around for 3 years at this point in the 4.x dev cycle without a very compelling reason.\r\n> \r\n> The code for the error has been there for a long time, but for some unknown reason the error didn't hit in previous versions. And default case is allowed at the top of switch scopes in GLSL. Right now it is a breaking change in behavior between 4.3 and 4.4 to the user, which I'm trying to fix. But yeah, I get your concern for potential side effects.\r\n\r\nThe fix should target the code that changed instead of deleting the error check altogether. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676522314/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2679590044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2679590044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2679590044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ft0yc","user":{"login":"Murrent","id":43298787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjk4Nzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43298787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent","html_url":"https://github.com/Murrent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T20:37:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T02:06:15Z","body":"I found that with this fix, if you have:\r\n```glsl\r\nvoid test() {\r\n\tswitch (0) {\r\n\t\tdefault:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\tdefault:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\tcase 0:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t};\r\n}\r\n```\r\nWe get an error as expected, but if we have:\r\n```glsl\r\nvoid test() {\r\n\tswitch (0) {\r\n\t\tdefault:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\tcase 0:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\tdefault:\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t};\r\n}\r\n```\r\nWe don't get an error and the editor hangs,","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2679590044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2679606601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2679606601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2679606601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ft41J","user":{"login":"Murrent","id":43298787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjk4Nzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43298787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent","html_url":"https://github.com/Murrent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Murrent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T20:45:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T02:06:54Z","body":"> I found that with this fix, if you have:\r\n> \r\n> [...]\r\n> \r\n> We get an error as expected, but if we have:\r\n> \r\n> [...]\r\n> \r\n> We don't get an error and the editor hangs,\r\n\r\nNow this is fixed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2679606601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683101513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103177#issuecomment-2683101513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103177","id":2683101513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f7OFJ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T19:40:52Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T19:41:16Z","body":"Looks good to me! Could you squash the commits? See [PR workflow](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html#the-interactive-rebase) for instructions.\r\n\r